  "name": "doi-10-5281-zenodo-8145113",
  "notes": "The IEA Wind Task 52 General Meeting 2023 took place online. The meeting was designed to provide information about the current status of wind lidar technology, the Task 52 working groups and the collaboration with other IEA Wind Tasks. The virtual meeting was organised as a mix of presentations, discussions and polls. Attached are the meeting minutes and all presentation (see agenda in minutes) given during the 2-day meeting.",
